I'll give you a couple answers. Yes, there's a sort-of limit to how
much you can enchant armor, and it's more than +3. No, this probably
didn't happen to you. If your cloak "crumbled to dust", then you read
an uncursed scroll of _destroy_ armor. If you had overenchanted, it
would have been a lot more spectacular.

